# ---- The creteholidayhome scrape --------------------------------------------
# 168 files pulled from the sister site during Phase 0. Sixteen of them are
# referenced by the inventory or the source; the other 152 (38 MB) are not
# referenced anywhere and are excluded. Ignore the directory contents, then
# re-admit exactly the sixteen. (`_chh/*` and not `_chh/` — git will not
# reconsider a negation inside an excluded directory.)
